  "excerptEn": "Eurowindow triple-layer aluminum doors offer exceptional soundproofing up to 44dB, thanks to their unique structure with Argon gas and polyamide thermal breaks.",
  "contentEn": "<div className=\"en-article-body\">\n    <p className=\"lead font-bold text-base text-[#005ba7]\">Eurowindow Official News Release — Triple-Layer Aluminum Doors - Unique Structure, Superior Soundproofing</p>\n    \n<p> </p><p className=\"MsoNormal\"></p><p className=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom: 0in;\"><span Times New Roman\\\",serif; font-size: 12pt; line-height: 107%;\">Living on a busy street with constant traffic and honking horns, how do you maintain a peaceful sleep for your children?<o:p></o:p></span></p>\n\n<p className=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom: 0in;\"><span Times New Roman\\\",serif; font-size: 12pt; line-height: 107%;\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun: yes;\"> </span>If you like singing Karaoke or cheering for football matches, is there a way to keep your space private and maintain peace for your neighbors?<o:p></o:p></span></p>\n\n<p className=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom: 0in;\"><span Times New Roman\\\",serif; font-size: 12pt; line-height: 107%;\">Check out Eurowindow triple-layer aluminum doors immediately. <o:p></o:p></span></p>\n\n<p className=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom: 0in;\"><span Times New Roman\\\",serif; font-size: 12pt; line-height: 107%;\">They feature a unique structure for superior soundproofing up to over 44dB!<o:p></o:p></span></p>\n\n<p className=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom: 0in;\"><span Times New Roman\\\",serif; font-size: 12pt; line-height: 107%;\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun: yes;\"> </span>Double or Triple-layer insulated glass units (IGU): Argon gas is injected between the glass layers, helping to eliminate sound effectively.<o:p></o:p></span></p>\n\n<p className=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom: 0in;\"><span Times New Roman\\\",serif; font-size: 12pt; line-height: 107%;\">Triple-layer structure profile: Consists of two 6063-T5 aluminum profiles connected by a polyamide thermal break with a multi-chamber structure, reinforcing ribs, and carefully calculated technical grooves.<o:p></o:p></span></p>\n\n<p className=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom: 0in;\"><span Times New Roman\\\",serif; font-size: 12pt; line-height: 107%;\">3-tier EPDM double gasket: Long-leg glass pressing gasket design forms 3 hollow chambers, combined with synchronized hardware accessories: multi-point locks, handles, hinges, safety latches… <o:p></o:p></span></p>\n\n<p className=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom: 0in;\"><span Times New Roman\\\",serif; font-size: 12pt; line-height: 107%;\">Not only providing outstanding soundproofing, Eurowindow triple-layer aluminum doors also possess effective thermal insulation and waterproofing capabilities, keeping the interior space dry and comfortable. <o:p></o:p></span></p><p className=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom: 0in;\"></p><div className=\"separator\" style=\"clear: both; text-align: center;\"><a href=\"https://blogger.googleusercontent.com/img/b/R29vZ2xl/AVvXsEiIXADluzs9vSj5v-GcoZBCVC_VeQvN9PE9gqOF6IncIS-EJRVyDJ9M3qsJUdAqRL1RfkD861Fv311Kz06KQezY_7aDYTizeK6v20wxCgRBR_07leMRsWZCvY5kL7Th_BJrwYyTdV2exaX_jSsQZpa8YawGu7MK1icPxFPlACa7waaonk2ouuBlZpuXmxDh/s800/eurowindow-2.webp\" style=\"margin-left: 1em; margin-right: 1em;\"><img alt=\"Cửa Nhôm Eurowindow 3 Lớp - Cấu Tạo Khác Biệt, Cách Âm Ưu Việt\" border=\"0\" data-original-height=\"800\" data-original-width=\"800\" src=\"https://blogger.googleusercontent.com/img/b/R29vZ2xl/AVvXsEiIXADluzs9vSj5v-GcoZBCVC_VeQvN9PE9gqOF6IncIS-EJRVyDJ9M3qsJUdAqRL1RfkD861Fv311Kz06KQezY_7aDYTizeK6v20wxCgRBR_07leMRsWZCvY5kL7Th_BJrwYyTdV2exaX_jSsQZpa8YawGu7MK1icPxFPlACa7waaonk2ouuBlZpuXmxDh/s16000/eurowindow-2.webp\" title=\"Cửa Nhôm 3 Lớp - Cấu Tạo Khác Biệt, Cách Âm Ưu Việt\" /></a></div><p></p>\n\n<p className=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom: 0in;\"><span Times New Roman\\\",serif; font-size: 12pt; line-height: 107%;\">Eurowindow triple-layer aluminum doors – A solution to elevate the quality of life for Vietnamese families.<o:p></o:p></span></p>\n\n<p className=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom: 0in;\"><span Times New Roman\\\",serif; font-size: 12pt; line-height: 107%;\">Let us construct and complete your project.<o:p></o:p></span></p>\n\n<p className=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom: 0in;\"><span Times New Roman\\\",serif; font-size: 12pt; line-height: 107%;\">Eurowindow is proud to accompany thousands of residential and civil projects nationwide, providing optimal door and glass solutions in aesthetics, durability, soundproofing, and thermal insulation.<o:p></o:p></span></p><p className=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom: 0in;\"></p><div className=\"separator\" style=\"clear: both; text-align: center;\"><a href=\"https://blogger.googleusercontent.com/img/b/R29vZ2xl/AVvXsEhQFPR2KtFoiVi3TRz1OysRMh9KunZvsvxkZq_uzexmMKRP7vje2HPJ2qHbBj2SNJW8py9MZLDcGssbEffV2vnTyJnPkHUWlPrVKRuBG54YE5oqiCPsFZSmDG8HsZv7KnVXdGBcy8A_CxlMcxgK16PALpdN4VQjnrtM4UGswsrGUbgbK5d2EF6zNA803jZK/s800/eurowindow-1.webp\" style=\"margin-left: 1em; margin-right: 1em;\"><img alt=\"Cửa Nhôm Eurowindow 3 Lớp - Cấu Tạo Khác Biệt, Cách Âm Ưu Việt\" border=\"0\" data-original-height=\"800\" data-original-width=\"800\" src=\"https://blogger.googleusercontent.com/img/b/R29vZ2xl/AVvXsEhQFPR2KtFoiVi3TRz1OysRMh9KunZvsvxkZq_uzexmMKRP7vje2HPJ2qHbBj2SNJW8py9MZLDcGssbEffV2vnTyJnPkHUWlPrVKRuBG54YE5oqiCPsFZSmDG8HsZv7KnVXdGBcy8A_CxlMcxgK16PALpdN4VQjnrtM4UGswsrGUbgbK5d2EF6zNA803jZK/s16000/eurowindow-1.webp\" title=\"Cửa Nhôm 3 Lớp - Cấu Tạo Khác Biệt, Cách Âm Ưu Việt\" /></a></div><p></p>\n\n<p className=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom: 0in;\"><span Times New Roman\\\",serif; font-size: 12pt; line-height: 107%;\">From drawings to reality, every detail is carefully handled by Eurowindow to ensure:<o:p></o:p></span></p>\n\n<p className=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom: 0in;\"><span Times New Roman\\\",serif; font-size: 12pt; line-height: 107%;\">On-schedule construction<o:p></o:p></span></p>\n\n<p className=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom: 0in;\"><span Times New Roman\\\",serif; font-